<div class="resources">
    <h3>Reference Docs</h3>
    <p>Need a deeper explanation? These pages cover the same concepts:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-06/index.html">Unit 6: Jumping</a> — jump budgets, capability design, and the mercy timers that came in 6.3</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-02/index.html">Unit 2: Stats &amp; Pickups</a> — the pickup family this one belongs to</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/reference/unity-csharp-quickref.html">Unity + C# Quick Reference</a> — the <em>Pickup</em> pattern, <code>Time.deltaTime</code>, and Rigidbody2D</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/ask.html">How do I&hellip;? index</a> — find this lesson again by the question you were asking</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Next: <a href="6.5.html">6.5 — Platforming Studio: The Gauntlet</a>, where every one of these skills has to survive a stranger.</p>
</div>`;
